{"articleNo":"141669","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=141669&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관] 2015-동계방학 생활관 합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.12.08","hit":"3861","attachments":[{"name":"2015학년도 동계방학 합격자.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=141669&attachNo=75184"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015-동계방학 생활관 합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 생활관 합격자 확인 : [원스톱서비스 - 학생지원 - 생활관 - 신청결과] 에서 확인 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong></strong></font></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>▣ 등록안내</strong></font></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 납부기간</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 12. 8(화) ~ 12. 11(금) 16:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 납부은행</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 고지서 출력</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">라. 농협 방문 납부 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">마. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 방문 납부 아닐시 17시까지 이체 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">바. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #666666; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #f40000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</span> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 문의</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 푸름관(478-7943, 7944), 오름관(478-7201,7202)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 2015학년 동계방학 추가 모집 안내는 추후에 공지할 예정입니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015. 12. 8.</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
